<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Template allows you to quickly create links to translated page DA Builder Wiki using the language of the current page:
</p>
<table border="1">
<tr>
<th style="background:#EEEEFF">Source code
</th>
<th style="background:#EEEEFF">Condition
</th>
