<td rowspan="3"><pre>{{Translate-link|Main Page}}</pre>
</td>
<td>If the language of the current page could not be extracted
</td>
<td><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Home" title="Main Page">Translate-link: <span style="color:#CC2200">GETTING_LANGUAGE_ERROR</span></a>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>If the page translated into current language exists (i.e. this page in Russian)
